        <mxCell id="nodes" value="&lt;b&gt;Managed node group pool-0&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;2x m5.large, AL2023, hub VPC private subnets&lt;br&gt;addons: vpc-cni, coredns, kube-proxy, eks-pod-identity-agent" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#82b366;align=left;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="spoke">
